# {{.Name}}

A terminal program built on [tui](https://github.com/ows4444/tui).

```console
$ go mod tidy
$ go run .
$ go test ./...
```

- `main.go` is the program: a `Model` with `Init`, `Update` and `View`.
- `main_test.go` runs it headless with `tuitest` and reads the screen.

